set_option autoImplicit false
-- FG circuit pilot S2s: port of Tools.ShippingChildTeleLocalA onto the context-predicate bundles (RefLawsAOpsX / RefLawsATeleX); generated by a rename-only script (names + suffix X, `AdmCtx O.quiet` -> `O.adm`). No sorry/axiom/native_decide/TRUSTED/law.

namespace Tools.ShippingChildTeleLocalA
open Lean Meta
open Tools.ShippingChildInv
